<title>USA: Warren Cty JCEC, Ky., won by Prudential Sec.</title>
<headline>Warren Cty JCEC, Ky., won by Prudential Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said it won $22.750 million of Warren Cty Justice Center Expansion Corp., Ky., first mortgage revenue bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.3756 percent.</p>
</text>
